---
import Base from "~/layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base
  title="Terms of Service"
  description="Terms of Service for the Hantavirus Cruise Tracker."
  current="terms"
  ogType="article"
  breadcrumbs={[{ name: "Terms of Service", path: "/terms/" }]}
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container narrow">
      <p class="eyebrow">Legal</p>
      <h1>Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="muted lede">Effective date: May 8, 2026</p>

      <article class="prose">
        <p>
          These Terms of Service (“Terms”) govern your access to and use of Hantavirus Cruise
          Tracker (the “Site”). By accessing or using the Site, you agree to these Terms. If you do
          not agree, do not use the Site.
        </p>

        <h2>1. What this Site is (and is not)</h2>
        <p>
          The Site is an independent, source-linked tracker that aggregates and summarizes publicly
          available information about the MV Hondius hantavirus outbreak. The Site is provided for
          general informational purposes only.
        </p>
        <p>
          The Site is <strong>not</strong> medical advice, public-health guidance, legal advice, or
          travel advice. Do not rely on the Site to make medical or emergency decisions. Always
          consult official public-health agencies and qualified professionals.
        </p>

        <h2>2. No warranties</h2>
        <p>
          The Site is provided on an “as is” and “as available” basis. We make no warranties of any
          kind, whether express, implied, or statutory, including warranties of accuracy,
          completeness, reliability, merchantability, fitness for a particular purpose, and
          non-infringement.
        </p>
        <p>
          Outbreak information changes quickly. Some items may be incomplete, time-sensitive, or
          later corrected by primary sources.
        </p>

        <h2>3. Limitation of liability</h2>
        <p>
          To the fullest extent permitted by law, we will not be liable for any indirect,
          incidental, special, consequential, or punitive damages, or any loss of profits, data,
          use, goodwill, or other intangible losses, resulting from your access to or use of (or
          inability to access or use) the Site.
        </p>

        <h2>4. External links and third-party content</h2>
        <p>
          The Site links to third-party websites and may quote or summarize third-party materials.
          We do not control third-party sites and are not responsible for their content, policies,
          or practices. Accessing third-party sites is at your own risk.
        </p>

        <h2>5. Acceptable use</h2>
        <p>You agree not to:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Use the Site in any way that violates applicable laws or regulations.</li>
          <li>Attempt to disrupt, damage, or interfere with the Site or its security.</li>
          <li>
            Use automated systems to scrape or crawl the Site in a way that unreasonably burdens
            infrastructure.
          </li>
          <li>
            Misrepresent the Site’s content, or present it as official guidance from any health
            authority or cruise operator.
          </li>
        </ul>

        <h2>6. Intellectual property</h2>
        <p>
          The Site’s original content and design are protected by applicable intellectual property
          laws. Third-party trademarks, logos, and content remain the property of their respective
          owners. Source links are provided for attribution and verification.
        </p>

        <h2>7. Changes to the Site or Terms</h2>
        <p>
          We may update the Site or these Terms at any time. Changes take effect when posted on
          this page. Your continued use of the Site after changes are posted constitutes acceptance
          of the updated Terms.
        </p>

        <h2>8. Contact</h2>
        <p>
          For questions or corrections, please use the repository issues page:
          <a href="https://github.com/judexuhs/Hantavirus-cruise">GitHub — Hantavirus-cruise</a>.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .narrow {
    max-width: 56rem;
  }
  .lede {
    font-size: var(--fs-md);
    max-width: var(--prose-max);
    margin-bottom: var(--sp-6);
  }
  .prose :global(ul) {
    padding-left: var(--sp-5);
  }
  .prose :global(li) {
    margin-bottom: var(--sp-2);
  }
</style>
